 Code Level Overview (Level 4)
Main classes / functions:
- class GraphNode: Represents individual nodes with key values, parent pointers, and neighbor lists.
- class GraphSearch: Stores adjacency representations and coordinates traversal execution.
- def bfs_search(graph, start, target): Implements queue-based breadth-first traversal logic.
- def dfs_search(graph, start, target): Implements stack-based depth-first traversal logic.
- def build_path(target_node): Backtracks parent pointers to generate the final path.

